%!PS
% Test content for process.ps: the fewest steps (three), short strings, no path
% back; paper theme. `psanim check process-tea.ps` runs process.ps with it.
/tpl (process.ps) component
/film /tpl << /Params <<
  /look /paper
  /heading (Making tea)
  /steps [ [ (boil) (Heat the water.) ] [ (steep) (Leave the leaves in.) ] [ (pour) (Serve it hot.) ] ]
  /key 1
  /why (Timing the steep sets the taste.) 
  /loop [ ]
  /summary (Three steps, one that matters.)
>> >> instance
<< /Size [1280 720] /Duration /film componentduration /FPS 30 >> animation
/scene { /film << /After /hold >> place } def
